stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED : Order created by Checkout Service<br/>(reservation converted to order)

    CREATED        --> PAYMENT_PENDING : Payment initiated
    CREATED        --> CANCELLED       : Buyer cancels before payment

    PAYMENT_PENDING --> CONFIRMED  : PaymentSucceeded event consumed<br/>(OrderEventConsumer → OrderStateMachine)
    PAYMENT_PENDING --> CREATED    : PaymentFailed event — reservation released, order retryable
    PAYMENT_PENDING --> CANCELLED  : Buyer cancels while awaiting payment result

    CONFIRMED  --> PROCESSING    : Warehouse picks and packs order
    CONFIRMED  --> CANCELLED     : Admin cancels (before dispatch)

    PROCESSING --> SHIPPED       : Shipment dispatched — tracking number assigned
    SHIPPED    --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY : Last-mile scan by courier
    OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> DELIVERED  : Delivery confirmed

    DELIVERED  --> [*]
    CANCELLED  --> [*]

    note right of CREATED         : OrderStateMachine.ALLOWED_TRANSITIONS\nenforces every edge shown here
    note right of PAYMENT_PENDING : Transition to CONFIRMED driven\nby async SQS event, not sync call
    note right of CANCELLED       : CANCELLED is a terminal state.\nNo further transitions allowed.
